sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant FE as Copilot panel
  participant CS as CopilotService
  participant G as Gemini API
  participant T as CopilotTools
  participant DB as MySQL
  S->>FE: "Which skill should I learn next?"
  FE->>CS: POST /api/student/copilot (last 10 messages)
  CS->>G: system rules + conversation + 8 tool declarations
  G-->>CS: functionCall get_skill_opportunities
  CS->>T: run tool for THIS student (id from JWT)
  T->>DB: profile, open jobs
  T-->>CS: ranking: Spring Boot +4 jobs ...
  CS->>G: model turn (unchanged) + functionResponse
  G-->>CS: answer text (may call more tools first, max 5 rounds)
  CS-->>FE: reply + action buttons + "Based on Opportunity Math"
  FE-->>S: "Learn Spring Boot first..." [Show on my map]
  Note over CS,G: No API key, quota used up or an error?<br/>Offline mode answers with the same tools and rules
  Note over S,FE: Apply and other actions<br/>happen only when the student clicks
